  help:"In a hospital the line between the fixed installation and the moveable machine runs through the middle of most equipment. The room, its shielding and its dedicated services are usually fixed; the machine standing in it usually isn’t. Knowing which side an earlier claim covered stops us counting the same thing twice.",
  opts:PH_FAMILIES.concat([["unsure","Not sure"]]),
